<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Graco cut to hold from buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Graco cut to hold from buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth Inc said Wednesday it cut its rating on Graco Inc to hold from buy, based solely on price.</p>
<p>-- Graco shares were down 5/8 at 35-1/2 Wednesday, but above Dain Bosworth's $35 a share price target, Dain Bosworth said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
